    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"By the time the rifle goes off, the rumor has already moved house.\"</em></p><p><strong>Can't Catch Me (1/Soma Break).</strong> Bonus action — take the Dash or Disengage.</p><p><strong>Light-Footed.</strong> Difficult terrain caused by undergrowth, brush, snow drifts, or scrap-strewn ground does not slow you. You can move along narrow ledges, fences, branches, or rooftops at full speed without making a check unless they are actively crumbling.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"crypJackCantCatch\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Can't Catch Me</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Bonus action  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Take the Dash or Disengage.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
